          "title": "Buka Rule yang Ingin Diedit",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Buka **Scenario Management**, cari rule yang ingin diedit\n• Klik nama rule atau ikon **✏️ Edit**\n• Hanya rule **Draft** yang bisa diedit langsung\n• Rule **Active** harus di-deactivate dulu",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
