        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Yang Bisa Diedit",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Parameter** — Nama, deskripsi, risk score, priority\n• **Flow** — Tambah/hapus/edit node, ubah koneksi\n• **Group** — Tambah/hapus/edit group\n• Setelah selesai, klik **Save** atau **Submit**",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
